      "caption": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "White flower that blooms in catacombs.\nEach a soundless bell used to summon spirits.\n\nStrengthens ashes to +1.\n\nThe art of strengthening ashes is known as spirit tuning. Only a spirit tuner may perform this deed.",
        "provenance": {
          "source": "legacy_db_data",
          "method": "copied from legacy ItemTexts.Caption"
        }
      },
      "description": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Strengthen ashes to +1",
        "provenance": {
          "source": "legacy_db_data",
          "method": "copied from legacy ItemTexts.Description"
        }
      },
      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "2x inside the Tombsward Catacombs at the Weeping Peninsula : One found in the room to the right of the boss door. A second one is found near a sarcophagus on the bottom level of the first room with a second floor. [ Map Link ]; 3x inside the Impaler's Catacombs at the Weeping Peninsula . The first is found on top of a sarcophagus in the room to the left of the boss door. A second one can be found in the second section of the sewers with Zombies, after dropping down underneath the Impaler Lift and one more can be found in the third section before climbing up the ladder. [ Map Link ]; 5x found in the Stormfoot Catacombs : The first one is found by a stine coffin in the room with the boss door. The second one is found in the next room, behind a pillar near the entrance to the narrow corridor. The third is found after climbing the ladder in the hallway where the second flamethrower pillar is. The fourth is found in a room west of where you got the third one. The final one is found to the left of the boss' door's lever. [ Map Link ]",
        "provenance": {
          "source": "legacy_db_data",
          "method": "copied from legacy ItemTexts.Location"
        }
